      "content": "You are right to feel the exhaustion they show, but their fatigue is a sign of their own limits, not a verdict on your worth. You deserve to be seen as more than just a burden, even if your current pain makes that hard to believe. Please consider reaching out to a helpline or a therapist who can help you navigate this heavy feeling without having to carry it alone.",
