      "content": "i just can't shake the thought that if i wasn't here, they could finally breathe again. they could just live their lives without always worrying if i'm okay or if i've managed to do something simple. it feels like the only way i could actually be kind to them is to just stop being a drain on them. it almost feels like the most selfless thing left to do.",
